	"descriptionMarkdown": "July 26: complete redesign - smaller, faster, more storage, more turrents more energy efficient\n\n- Designed for non-stop travel between Nauvis-Fulgora-Aquilo (round trip time ~5,5min)\n- only common quality\n- ~290 km/s \n- designed for projectile and explosive damage 7 and asteroid productivity 0\n- requires v2.1 inserters\n- self sufficient (except for nuclear fuel cells), idling around Aquilo requires 1 fuel cell every ~30min\n- excess power in case you want to fiddle with modules\n- solar cells are incorporated, no need for start up platform\n- while low on steam, foundry production is stopped so that grabbers can work at full capacity, reducing start up time\n- calcite can be supplied externally, further reducing startup time\n- thruster only supplied with fuel, if you have enough ammo -> you should be able to send it to gleba/fulgora right after building. Will depart as soon as ready.",
